# OfflinePay AI — Final PayPal AI Hackathon Checklist

This is the consolidated checklist covering implementation, AI evaluation, security, PayPal integration, user experience, judging criteria and submission. It is tailored to your existing Spring Boot offline-payment project, so it emphasizes completing and proving the core features rather than rebuilding what already works.

Priority guide

- P0 — Essential: complete before treating the project as submission-ready.
- P1 — Important: improves quality, credibility and judging performance.
- P2 — Optional: implement only after the core demo works reliably.

